      <activity id="a5274b21-8769-517a-a7b6-c3d6ac181505" activityNameId="0cd1b108-9324-59ec-b62f-c930585fa06a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ventilated ceiling system, commercial kitchen</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ventilated ceiling system, commercial kitchen
Production of a ventilated ceiling system, commercial kitchen with 5'000-20'000 m3/h nominal air flow rate of the kitchen. Reference value of inventory is 1 m3/h air flow of the kitchen. Inventory is an average of 3 commercial kitchens with a total nominal air flow of  37670 m3/h, specific weight of the components: 0.2 kg/(m3/h). Exhaust and supply air ceiling system mainly made of stainless steel and aluminium. Stainless steel exhaust air hood for kitchen and/or dishwasher included. No ducts included.;
UUID: c6b2bccc-3afd-3e8e-b361-51b3da891168
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps and for heating the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for infrastructure of the production site included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for ventilation systems in commercial and public buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Process information partly from 2003 to 2012
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from different call of bids for ventilation system used. Data completed with information from literature and from manufacturers 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c6b2bccc-3afd-3e8e-b361-51b3da891168.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
